1
00:00:45,679 --> 00:00:47,880
As expected of a business tycoon
in Nigang.

2
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:49,320
(song)
Even his assistant's stuff

3
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,960
is so fancy.

4
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:03,759
So many people are scrambling

5
00:01:03,759 --> 00:01:05,200
to work for the Song family.

6
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:06,680
They're not just after the money.

7
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:07,599
It's about status.

8
00:01:08,319 --> 00:01:09,480
Are you happy?

9
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:10,680
Of course I am.

10
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:13,879
Song Cheng is his illegitimate daughter.

11
00:01:13,879 --> 00:01:15,480
A car crash three years ago

12
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:17,159
damaged her spine and paralyzed her.

13
00:01:17,599 --> 00:01:19,040
She hasn't been able to stand since.

14
00:01:19,319 --> 00:01:21,560
Ms. Chen doesn't even give her
the time of day.

15
00:01:22,079 --> 00:01:23,359
That's why I got my shot.

16
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:24,719
But Song,

17
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:28,079
are you really gonna latch
onto the Song family

18
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:31,120
and take their place?

19
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:36,640
=Dear Song=

20
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:39,000
=Episode 2=
(Latching Onto the Perfect Family)

21
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:05,079
(Today is
Song Huaishan's 67th birthday.)

22
00:02:05,079 --> 00:02:06,560
(How ironic.)

23
00:02:06,959 --> 00:02:09,680
(His family's doing pretty well.)

24
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:12,680
(But I believe justice will be served.)

25
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:14,919
(I'll gather all the evidence)

26
00:02:15,319 --> 00:02:17,120
(and bring him to justice.)

27
00:02:24,439 --> 00:02:25,000
Ms. Chen.

28
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,159
Is there something you need?

29
00:02:26,319 --> 00:02:29,039
Ms. Song Cheng is wearing this
to the birthday banquet.

30
00:02:29,039 --> 00:02:30,120
Go get her changed.

31
00:02:30,719 --> 00:02:33,319
She ordered a pink dress.

32
00:02:33,759 --> 00:02:35,479
And it wasn't even this style.

33
00:02:35,919 --> 00:02:37,120
Look at this fabric.

34
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,759
This isn't from a couture shop, is it?

35
00:02:39,039 --> 00:02:40,240
That dress?

36
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:42,039
Ms. Song Lin had her eye on it.

37
00:02:42,159 --> 00:02:43,080
Besides,

38
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:45,680
Ms. Song Cheng is just a cripple.

39
00:02:45,759 --> 00:02:47,240
She's in a wheelchair all day.

40
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:49,560
What's the point of dressing her up?

41
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,639
It's Mr. Song's birthday today.

42
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:53,520
If anything happens to Ms. Song Cheng,

43
00:02:53,719 --> 00:02:54,840
it makes Mr. Song look bad.

44
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:56,840
You don't actually think

45
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:58,319
Mr. Song cares that much about her,
do you?

46
00:02:59,039 --> 00:02:59,719
Yu Song,

47
00:02:59,719 --> 00:03:01,479
you're just a personal assistant.

48
00:03:01,479 --> 00:03:03,000
Just do your job.

49
00:03:03,439 --> 00:03:05,080
The Song family?

50
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,240
Those waters run deeper than you know.

51
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:07,840
Butt in,

52
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,840
and you might just drown.

53
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:32,879
Ms. Song Cheng!

54
00:03:41,039 --> 00:03:41,960
Are you okay?

55
00:03:56,719 --> 00:03:58,159
That dress doesn't fit you at all.

56
00:03:58,639 --> 00:04:00,039
You're gonna get hurt tonight.

57
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:01,479
I'll go talk to Ms. Chen again.

58
00:04:01,479 --> 00:04:02,280
No need.

59
00:04:03,879 --> 00:04:05,879
I'll just be careful tonight.

60
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,520
It's fine.

61
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:21,519
Ms. Song Cheng,

62
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:24,560
most people dress to cover up
and keep warm.

63
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:26,360
But you're a Song.

64
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:28,040
Your clothes should flatter you.

65
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:37,639
Do you have a belt?

66
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:40,879
No.

67
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:43,759
I threw them all out after I got hurt.

68
00:05:08,199 --> 00:05:09,000
Yu Song.

69
00:05:09,399 --> 00:05:10,199
What are you doing?

70
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:13,160
Making the dress fit you,
Ms. Song Cheng.

71
00:05:37,439 --> 00:05:38,240
Yu Song.

72
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:40,240
You're really handy.

73
00:05:40,279 --> 00:05:42,079
You made this dress look so good.

74
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,639
Use the right touch,

75
00:05:43,759 --> 00:05:46,399
and even the plainest material
can shine.

76
00:05:49,439 --> 00:05:49,920
Ms. Song Lin,

77
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:50,839
you're back.

78
00:05:51,199 --> 00:05:51,759
Mr. Zhao, here.

79
00:05:51,759 --> 00:05:52,160
Let me take that.

80
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:54,439
I heard the little illegitimate child
can't do anything herself,

81
00:05:54,439 --> 00:05:56,839
so she brought in an outsider
to cozy up to Dad.

82
00:05:56,839 --> 00:05:57,399
She

83
00:05:57,399 --> 00:05:59,519
is just some phony
who came back from abroad.

84
00:05:59,519 --> 00:06:01,360
Nothing compared to you.

85
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:03,360
So what's next?

86
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:05,240
Send her to the old man's bed?

87
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,279
To make her our stepmom?

88
00:06:06,639 --> 00:06:07,879
Lin.

89
00:06:07,879 --> 00:06:08,639
We're almost home.

90
00:06:08,879 --> 00:06:09,839
Watch your mouth.

91
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,040
This is my house!

92
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:13,839
Why should I watch my mouth?

93
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,120
Other than Song Huan,

94
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,920
even the two of them together

95
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:20,480
aren't worth my attention.

96
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:30,240
Ms. Chen,

97
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:32,120
this is the birthday gift Lin got
especially for Dad.

98
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,120
(Fire Hydrant, Fire Extinguisher)
I'll take it.

99
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:33,839
Oh.

100
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,000
Nice.

101
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:39,759
Yu Song.

102
00:06:40,759 --> 00:06:41,959
Ms. Song Lin wants to see you.

103
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:51,000
(BAZAAR)

104
00:06:56,759 --> 00:06:58,000
Hi, Ms. Song Lin.

105
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,720
I'm Ms. Song Cheng's personal assistant.

106
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:00,240
My name's Yu Song.

107
00:07:03,279 --> 00:07:04,519
Ugh, men.

108
00:07:04,519 --> 00:07:05,800
So clumsy!

109
00:07:11,079 --> 00:07:12,160
You do my nails.

110
00:07:13,639 --> 00:07:14,439
Ms. Song Lin,

111
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,519
that's not part of my job.

112
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:22,160
What?

113
00:07:22,639 --> 00:07:25,160
The Song family pays your salary.

114
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,120
Can't you just paint my nails?

115
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,519
Exactly.

116
00:07:28,759 --> 00:07:29,759
What's your problem?

117
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:31,680
You think Lin can't order you around?

118
00:07:36,319 --> 00:07:38,839
(Today is Mr. Song's birthday banquet.)

119
00:07:39,079 --> 00:07:41,600
(He'll be home at two thirty sharp.)

120
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,160
Of course.

121
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:47,160
As long as you don't mind
my clumsy hands.

122
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:50,960
You hurt me on purpose, didn't you?

123
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:52,039
Sorry, Ms. Song Lin.

124
00:08:52,039 --> 00:08:54,039
I told you, I'm clumsy. I can't do this.

125
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,559
Can't do this?

126
00:08:59,879 --> 00:09:01,600
Then let me teach you how.

127
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:02,919
Lin!

128
00:09:03,159 --> 00:09:04,440
Don't hurt Yu Song.

129
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,559
Shut up!

130
00:09:05,879 --> 00:09:08,120
Since when do you get a say
in this house?

131
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:08,639
Stop it!

132
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:16,759
Are you okay?

133
00:09:22,559 --> 00:09:23,320
What are you doing?

134
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:31,200
You two are getting more out of line
by the day.

135
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:33,000
Come with me.

136
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:55,559
Don't cry, Ms. Song Cheng.

137
00:09:56,039 --> 00:09:56,879
I'm okay.

138
00:09:56,879 --> 00:09:57,559
Really.

139
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:04,039
(To a man,)

140
00:10:04,039 --> 00:10:05,480
(a woman's tears)

141
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:07,840
(are always the best weapon.)

142
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:10,240
(The more powerful the man,)

143
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,519
(the better it works.)

144
00:10:22,279 --> 00:10:23,399
Jing, you're busy in here.

145
00:10:24,039 --> 00:10:25,240
You're such a good kid.

146
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,240
Song Huan went ahead and snatched

147
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:33,200
the East Side hot spring project
from Zhao Hui.

148
00:10:33,639 --> 00:10:35,159
The birthday banquet could turn ugly.

149
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:37,120
Not necessarily.

150
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:38,840
With outsiders like us around,

151
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:41,960
even if he's furious, Song Huaishan
will keep up appearances.

152
00:10:43,159 --> 00:10:44,159
Be careful tonight.

153
00:10:44,159 --> 00:10:45,039
Don't get yourself burned.

154
00:10:45,759 --> 00:10:47,159
The bigger the fire,

155
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,639
the brighter Song Cheng will shine.

156
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:53,000
Someone's coming.

157
00:11:04,399 --> 00:11:06,279
How's that stolen food taste,

158
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:07,840
Huan?

159
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:09,360
Drop it, Lin.

160
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:10,200
Shut up!

161
00:11:12,799 --> 00:11:14,159
Of course stolen food

162
00:11:14,919 --> 00:11:15,799
tastes better.

163
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:21,399
Song Huan,

164
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:24,759
if you're so capable, face Zhao Hui
fair and square.

165
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,759
What's so impressive
about sneaking around

166
00:11:26,759 --> 00:11:27,799
and stealing his project?

167
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,840
I'm the company's general manager.

168
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:31,759
When it comes to Song Group projects,

169
00:11:31,759 --> 00:11:34,120
I'll take whichever one I want.

170
00:11:36,559 --> 00:11:37,600
Huan,

171
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:38,840
like Dad just said,

172
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:41,120
you and I are running
this project together.

173
00:11:41,799 --> 00:11:42,480
True.

174
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:43,480
You win.

175
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:45,279
But I haven't lost yet.

176
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:46,840
Let's

177
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:48,000
compete for projects on merit.

178
00:11:48,159 --> 00:11:48,919
Sounds good.

179
00:11:48,919 --> 00:11:50,039
We'll see.

180
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:52,399
Oh,

181
00:11:53,399 --> 00:11:55,799
get the spies you've planted around me
out of here.

182
00:11:55,799 --> 00:11:57,240
They've got families to feed.

183
00:11:57,759 --> 00:11:59,360
Don't get them fired.

184
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:01,759
Not like some people.

185
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:04,600
They can be utterly useless and still
live off the Song family.

186
00:12:05,759 --> 00:12:06,600
Song Huan,

187
00:12:06,600 --> 00:12:07,759
what did you say?

188
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:09,759
I'll rip that mouth of yours apart!

189
00:12:09,759 --> 00:12:10,480
Lin!

190
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:11,039
Calm down.

191
00:12:11,039 --> 00:12:11,759
Let go!

192
00:12:13,759 --> 00:12:14,759
Are you sure

193
00:12:15,519 --> 00:12:16,679
you want to make a scene tonight?

194
00:12:19,759 --> 00:12:20,919
(Song Huan really is the queen)

195
00:12:20,919 --> 00:12:23,440
(who runs half of
Song Group's business.)

196
00:12:23,559 --> 00:12:25,639
(In front of her, Song Lin looks)

197
00:12:25,639 --> 00:12:27,559
(like a rooster that lost a fight.)

198
00:12:29,559 --> 00:12:31,240
What are you sisters talking about?

199
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:32,600
Dad.

200
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:33,799
Happy birthday, Mr. Song.

201
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:35,240
Go on.

202
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:36,960
Dad, easy.

203
00:12:37,559 --> 00:12:38,879
Happy birthday, Dad.

204
00:12:38,879 --> 00:12:40,159
Happy birthday, Dad.

205
00:12:42,559 --> 00:12:43,279
Dad.

206
00:12:43,279 --> 00:12:43,960
Look.

207
00:12:44,039 --> 00:12:46,000
I picked this out just for you.

208
00:12:46,159 --> 00:12:46,960
Do you like it?

209
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:49,679
Isn't this the final work

210
00:12:49,679 --> 00:12:50,759
from my favorite painter?

211
00:12:50,759 --> 00:12:51,480
Yeah.

212
00:12:51,919 --> 00:12:53,080
To get this painting,

213
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:54,720
I went to three different auctions.

214
00:12:55,879 --> 00:12:56,720
Song Lin,

215
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:57,480
you really put thought into it.

216
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:03,759
What a coincidence.

217
00:13:05,159 --> 00:13:06,279
I got Dad

218
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:07,360
a painting too.
